Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.99,0:22:10.53,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}跑吧跑吧 快點逃跑吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.69,0:22:14.01,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}巫女小姐 巫女小姐 快點逃跑吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.04,0:22:16.44,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}反正你會跟上來的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.52,0:22:19.64,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}熊先生 熊先生 我都看穿了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.66,0:22:22.40,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}果然被發現了？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.68,0:22:25.29,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}畢竟我們
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.56,0:22:28.37,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}一直都在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.56,0:22:31.02,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}la se！la se la se la─
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.10,0:22:34.31,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}沒有信號 傳不到這
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.35,0:22:36.79,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}Wi-Fi 雖然是有
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.85,0:22:40.14,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}便利商店 都不是便利商店了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.20,0:22:42.65,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}因為是鄉下嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.71,0:22:48.60,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}太陽落山 夜幕降臨 山中小徑
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.65,0:22:51.80,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}1 2 3 4 DJ here we go
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.83,0:22:54.25,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}OK 村民 check it out！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.30,0:22:57.23,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}巫女小姐 巫女小姐 熊出村的巫女小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.26,0:23:00.10,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}好可愛 好可愛 還說沒有這回事
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.15,0:23:03.02,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}哥哥也好 姐姐也好 都是滑菇妖怪 怪怪怪
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.08,0:23:04.52,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}沒錯 沒錯 沒錯 沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.55,0:23:05.96,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}就是熊巫女之舞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.00,0:23:08.85,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}反正是熊巫女 DANCING
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.90,0:23:11.73,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}不跳的話 村 村 村民
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.78,0:23:14.62,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}明天也在這個村子
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.68,0:23:18.88,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}無論如何 都是Happy days
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.01,0:23:21.81,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}果然還是Happy days
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.92,0:23:26.28,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}超級Happy days
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.36,0:23:29.06,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}everybody body 大家Happy
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.18,0:23:30.53,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}好 就寢
