Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.14,0:01:04.92,OP-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}我今天也有點慌亂
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.95,0:01:06.38,OP-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}啊　睡過頭了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.59,0:01:08.18,OP-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}梳妝打扮可不能偷工減料
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.23,0:01:09.93,OP-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}不行不行，怎麼辦
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.09,0:01:11.66,OP-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}抓住{\fn华康少女字体\fs50}cute　心跳Magic！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.82,0:01:13.33,OP-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}這件連身裙，很適合我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.53,0:01:15.23,OP-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}不快點不行，已經這時間了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.33,0:01:16.98,OP-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}好，我出門了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.74,0:01:22.25,OP-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}原諒我吧　我也總有一天
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.46,0:01:25.12,OP-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}會長大成人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.16,0:01:31.27,OP-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}但你還要待在我身邊喔
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.64,0:01:35.92,OP-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}因為　因為　很可怕嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.12,0:01:39.48,OP-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}微微一笑　很困擾嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.61,0:01:42.38,OP-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}在你那大大的手臂之中
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.48,0:01:46.57,OP-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}我想一直撒嬌下去
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.60,0:01:49.92,OP-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}等等我　好好地　回應我
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.00,0:01:52.56,OP-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}別裝作沒聽到
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.67,0:01:58.68,OP-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}即使魔法消失
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.76,0:02:00.90,OP-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}緊緊　緊緊擁抱我
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.20,0:02:04.26,OP-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}再多　再多多擁抱我
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.67,0:02:07.83,OP-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}摸摸　摸摸我的頭
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.18,0:02:11.46,OP-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}再多　再多多摸摸我的頭
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
